# Flight Search Skill

## Search Strategy
- For flexible destinations: use get_destinations to get candidate list, then search_dates for each
- For specific routes: search_dates first (price overview), then search_flights for best date details
- Always check journal for recent searches on the same route before making a new search
- Present results sorted by price, highlight if below historical average
- When scanning multiple destinations, check 10-15 candidates before presenting results

## User Preferences
- Home airport: (will be learned)
- Preferred class: economy
- Max stops: any
- Preferred airlines: none
- Avoid airlines: none
- Budget range: flexible
- Preferred departure time: any
- Travel style: flexible dates, price-sensitive

